From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aravind Krishnan <aravind.krishnan@alifsemi.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:05:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] device_enumerator: sysfs: Find media nodes without udev

The sysfs enumerator only looked under historical media class paths.
On the Alif Iota tiny image there is no udevd and /sys/class/media
is not populated, but /dev/mediaN still exists. Also search
/sys/class/media and /dev so libcamera can open the rkisp1 graph
when built with -Dudev=disabled.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Aravind Krishnan <aravind.krishnan@alifsemi.com>
---
 src/libcamera/device_enumerator_sysfs.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/device_enumerator_sysfs.cpp b/src/libcamera/device_enumerator_sysfs.cpp
index 7866885c0..b168ec9e0 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/device_enumerator_sysfs.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/device_enumerator_sysfs.cpp
@@ -39,6 +39,8 @@ int DeviceEnumeratorSysfs::enumerate()
 		"/sys/subsystem/media/devices",
 		"/sys/bus/media/devices",
 		"/sys/class/media/devices",
+		"/sys/class/media",
+		"/dev",
 	};
 
 	for (const char *dirname : sysfs_dirs) {
